<title>BELGIUM: BARCO H1 1996 CONS NET UP 37 PCT.</title>
<headline>BARCO H1 1996 CONS NET UP 37 PCT.</headline>
<text>
<p>BRUSSELS, Sept 11, Reuter - Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(billions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net			   1.131 vs  0.823</p>
<p>    Cons net current		 1.305 vs  0.980</p>
<p>    Cons turnover		    8.882 vs  7.455</p>
<p>NOTE - Barco NV is a Belgian electronics group.  </p>
<p>    Goodwill writeoffs			0.174   vs   0.157</p>
<p>    Taxes					 0.309   vs   0.232</p>
<p>Barco said the acquisitions of Baasel-Scheel Lasergraphics GmbH, American Video Communications Inc and Maya Video Communications Inc, announced in May, were not consolidated in the first half 1996 figures.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
